          "comment": "[Playbook] California law is acceptable to us, but our playbook requires disputes to go to courts rather than mandatory arbitration, so we have replaced the AAA arbitration mechanic with exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts in San Francisco County, California, and conformed the heading and the escrow cross-reference.",
